VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_RedSilent::
    .string "RED: ……$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_RedHeals::
    .string "RED takes out a thermos and lets\n"
    .string "your POKéMON drink. They feel\n"
    .string "fine again.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_ShapeA::
    .string "The THRONE ROOM is freezing. RED\n"
    .string "kneels at its center, the BLACK\p"
    .string "OPAL in both hands. Above him\n"
    .string "stands a pale shape of shadow.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_ShapeB::
    .string "A cry rings inside your head, not\n"
    .string "in the air. A PSYCHIC cry.\p"
    .string "RED's hands open on their own.\n"
    .string "The BLACK OPAL floats away.\p"
    .string "Your bag shudders. The TOPAZ\n"
    .string "slips out and flies to the shape.\p"
    .string "Far away, a case snaps open.\n"
    .string "The APATITE answers the call too.\p"
    .string "Below, the seven stones sing and\n"
    .string "rise through the floor.\p"
    .string "The shape turns its head toward\n"
    .string "you. Everything goes black.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_ShapeC::
    .string "When the light returns, the shape\n"
    .string "is gone. Only RED remains.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_RedAfter::
    .string "RED lowers his head. He did not\n"
    .string "win. Nobody could.\p"
    .string "He looks at you, and nods once.$"

